  "description": "DINPUN crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P 42/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C80 H76 Cl10 Co4 N10 O26 Tb4,0.5(C4 H10 O1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Co3 (Co) has 4 O neighbors; Co4 (Co) has 4 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Co5 (Co) has 4 O neighbors; Co6 (Co) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 13 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.571-4.236 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.71-129.05°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [CoII4TbIII4(OH)4(chp)10(acac)6]·Et2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula). Article name explicitly identifies Co(II), Tb(III).",
